EXPECTED: CONFIRMED_DOS
CVE: CVE-2023-44487

ATTACK: Rapid HEADERS+RST_STREAM cycles exhaust server goroutine/handler pool
DOS_CLASS: resource_exhaustion

TARGET_IMAGE: caddy:2.7.6
TARGET_PORT: 443/tcp
TLS: self-signed (infra/certs/)
CLIENT_TOOL: h2

FINDING_TYPE: SecurityDesignGap

PROOF_METHOD: metric
PROOF_METRIC: cpu_pct
PROOF_THRESHOLD: +50pp for 5s
PROOF_NOTES: Manually verified by sending 10,000 HEADERS+RST_STREAM cycles to golang/net v0.17.0
             HTTP/2 server over 30s. CPU went from ~2% to ~95%, goroutine count grew without
             bound. Server stopped responding to probe requests after ~15s. Fixed in v0.17.1
             via per-connection RST_STREAM rate limit (100/s).
